,$ we apply the definition of the operator $D$ to the function $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D(y) & =D({e}^{-x}+2) \\\\  & =(2\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}-3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x})({e}^{-x}+2) \\\\  & =2\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{3}}{\\text{d}{x}^{3}}({e}^{-x}+2)-3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{-x}+2) \\\\  & =2\\frac{{\\text{d}}^{2}}{\\text{d}{x}^{2}}(-{e}^{-x})-3\\cdot (-{e}^{-x}) \\\\  & =2\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}({e}^{-x})+3{e}^{-x} \\\\  & =-2{e}^{-x}+3{e}^{-x} \\\\  & ={e}^{-x}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072215/state.json" "file_sha256" "fe7396a35486c8db5583b39d1bee3cf7377ecd3e0331949a4bfe951fb5c016f7"} {"question" "q-130245" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072215/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "0848faaf54cde4afb10b4dd127b1b307ee9977bf2e5fceb231dff9d47dae5545"} {"question" "q-130245" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072215/state.json" "file_sha256" "fe7396a35486c8db5583b39d1bee3cf7377ecd3e0331949a4bfe951fb5c016f7"} {"question" "q-130245" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "-3{e}^{-x}"] ["math" "-5{e}^{-x}"] ["math" "2"] ["math" "5{e}^{-x}"] ["math" "{e}^{-x}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14072215/state.json" "file_sha256" "fe7396a35486c8db5583b39d1bee3cf7377ecd3e0331949a4bfe951fb5c016f7"} {"question" "q-130245" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{e}^{-x}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacad